 "patch": "1.13.2.31687",
 "objectiveText": "Progress A Cenarion beacon will allow a well-trained skinner to spot patches of tainted skin from bounty gathered in Felwood .  I convert these seemingly useless patches into a thick paste that serves as a quickening agent for Cenarion plant salve .  When you skin your kills here in Felwood , be sure to have a beacon on you! When you collect tainted patches, bring them to me and I will give you some Cenarion plant salves that I have already made. Patch of Tainted Skin  ( 5 )",
