  {
   "rating": 12,
   "date": "2007-01-21T15:06:53-06:00",
   "body": "This quest is given by Arathandris Silversky (https://www.wowhead.com/forever/npc=9528) for alliance or Maybess Riverbreeze (https://www.wowhead.com/forever/npc=9529) for horde.\r\nYou must first complete their Cleansing Felwood quest for it to become available.",
   "replies": []
  },
  {
   "rating": 1,
   "date": "2020-02-24T00:29:13-06:00",
   "body": "I'm going to post this on all the Alliance versions of these quests as I have not found anyone commenting on more details about each.\r\n\r\nFrom my in-game experience and online research (checking both WoWPedia and WoWWiki), there is a limit to which of these quests each character will have available to them, based on the professions of said characters. Everyone will have the [Salve via Hunting] quests available while the other four will be determined from the aforementioned professions:\r\n\r\n[ul]\r\n[li]Only herbalists will have [Salve via Gathering] available[/li]\r\n[li]Only miners will have [Salve via Mining] available[/li]\r\n[li]Only skinners will have [Salve via Skinning] available[/li]\r\n[li]It appears only enchanters will have [Salve via Disenchanting] available to them (as the needed item is not BoP unlike the above three, I bought two on the AH and attempted to see if I could do the quest: it was not available to me even after a restart to further check)[/li]\r\n[/ul]\r\n\r\nNote that there are two versions of these quests for each faction: the first will give experience along with the salve and is a one time thing (like standard quests) while the second becomes available after and does not give experience, only the salve and is repeatable.",
   "replies": []
  }
 ]
}